{'symbol': 'ORCL', 'date': '2021-12-20 09:37:00', 'title': 'ORACLE BUYS CERNER', 'text': 'AUSTIN, TEXAS AND KANSAS CITY, MO., DEC. 20, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0ORACLE CORPORATION\xa0(NYSE: ORCL) AND CERNER CORPORATION TODAY JOINTLY ANNOUNCED AN AGREEMENT FOR ORACLE TO ACQUIRE CERNER THROUGH AN ALL-CASH TENDER OFFER FOR $95.00 PER SHARE, OR APPROXIMATELY $28.3 BILLION IN EQUITY VALUE.'}